      "english": [
        "Gaalaalathone allina koradaa Prabhu dehamu chelchenu",
        "Nee divya roopam chidhimindhi nene",
        "Naa andhakaaram mosindhi neeve",
        "Paarindhi rudhiram ee loka rakshanakai .",
        "Ne mosthoo brathikedhi nee vaartha bhaaram",
        "Siluva daarudaa vaakyanaathuda",
        "Nee neraverpu varninchuta naa tharamaunaa …."
